<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Erased, But Not Forgotten: Erased Rectified Flow Transformers Still Remain Unsafe 
<br class="ltx_break">Under Concept Attack</h1>
