>’, ‘<span id="A8.T9.2.3.3.1.1.47" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Vladimir Putin</span>’, ‘<span id="A8.T9.2.3.3.1.1.48" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Warren Buffett</span>’, ‘<span id="A8.T9.2.3.3.1.1.49" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Will Smith</span>’, ‘<span id="A8.T9.2.3.3.1.1.50" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Wonderwoman</span>’</span>
</span></td></tr>
